{
  "id": "section-794",
  "title": "对林彪同志一封来信的批语",
  "level": 0,
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-174.htm",
  "html": "<table><tbody><tr><td> -&gt;  -&gt; <a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》</a><hr>\n<b>174)</b>\n\n\n<br>\n<br>\n　　那些不相信突出政治，对突出政治表示阳奉阴违，而自己另外散布一套折衷主义（即机会主义的）的人们，大家应当有所警惕。<br><br><hr><p><a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-173.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">上一页</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">目录</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-175.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">下一页</a><br><br></p></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n"
